itation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-group><fig id="f1-wjem-9-0115" position="float"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>Endovaginal ultrasound with one live intrauterine pregnancy and a separate subchorionic hemorrhage resembling two gestational sacs. (S= subchorionic hemorrhage; G= gestational sac)</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="wjem-9-0115f1"/></fig></floats-group></article>